100
00:10:58,574 --> 00:11:01,956
You can split chunks that are too large for your embedding model.

101
00:11:02,288 --> 00:11:13,988
So remember this we get the data, we extract it, then we create the chunks, and then in the next step, we're going to send that to an embedding model to create the embedding, which we're going to store in the vector database.

