104
00:11:31,182 --> 00:11:34,448
So that is a total amount of input that you can send to that model.

105
00:11:34,574 --> 00:11:40,612
So you want to keep your chunks below that specific number of the embedding model that you are using.

106
00:11:41,102 --> 00:11:47,648
Now, what Dock Link Dang does is it is first going to split chunks that are too large for the embedding model.

107
00:11:47,728 --> 00:11:50,208
So say it exceeds this input.

108
00:11:50,894 --> 00:11:52,324
