109
00:11:52,910 --> 00:11:56,576
Then also it's going to stitch together chunks that are too small.

110
00:11:56,656 --> 00:12:02,916
So you might have a chunk which is just one header or a short paragraph, and it can fit that together.

111
00:12:03,246 --> 00:12:05,856
And it works with your specific tokenizer.

112
00:12:05,936 --> 00:12:10,660
